","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくださってありがとうございました💓\n高瀬愛奈／(o・ω・o)＼"}],"source":"archive"},"ofc-keya-30032":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは👋🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スマホの削除した画像を復元できる機能、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に便利だ〜、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でいただいたお花の写真、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元の画像とコメント入りの画像2つずつあるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログに載せたら、コメント入りの方は消してしまうのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"載せた気でいて、消してた🥺"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セーフ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日全部載せます!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この機能、気がついたら増えていた気がするのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつからだったかな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう機能付けたらどうですか?!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、提案する人凄いな〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと発想力が豊かになりたい😯💭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰にもできないような発想ができるようになりたいな〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのためには、たくさんの知識をつけなきゃだな〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早速、先日の握手会で頂いた祝花を載せたいと思います!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/0e0/78ac73faa2458232ccd37808c79ec.jpg","alt":""}